do when I hang the helmet

00:53:33.420 --> 00:53:35.960
up at 45, the next day I'm stepping into--

00:53:35.960 --> 00:53:38.310
- So I think one thing that
social really works out

00:53:38.310 --> 00:53:39.552
for all three of you
that I would tell you,

00:53:39.552 --> 00:53:41.440
it's an answer for all three of you.

00:53:41.440 --> 00:53:43.890
Become religious about the audience.

00:53:43.890 --> 00:53:47.180
I think the thing that Vince
and the whole crew there

00:53:47.180 --> 00:53:50.460
has done, and if you think
about when NASCAR does well

00:53:50.460 --> 00:53:52.310
or doesn't do well, or
other sports do well

00:53:52.310 --> 00:53:54.870
or don't do well, when I
think about my career and the

00:53:54.870 --> 00:53:57.480
things we do at this
company for marketing,

00:53:57.480 --> 00:53:59.380
I don't think people
care about the audience

00:53:59.380 --> 00:54:00.400
